  "accountDeletionCopyCatalog": "title=Delete my account~subtitle=Request deletion of your account and personal data~intro=This submits a request for an administrator to delete your account and the personal data associated with it. It does not delete your account instantly.~what=Your access to the app is revoked on request. Personal profile data is deleted; some fleet records created for your organisation may be retained as business or audit records and de-identified from your profile.~timeline=Verified requests are completed within about 30 days.~reason=Reason (optional)~confirm=Type DELETE to confirm~word=DELETE~submit=Submit deletion request~cancel=Cancel~successTitle=Request submitted~successBody=Your account deletion request has been recorded. An administrator will action it within about 30 days.~errorTitle=Could not submit request~mismatch=Type DELETE exactly to confirm.~unavailable=Account deletion is not available right now. Please email us to request deletion.~failed=Could not submit your request. Please try again.~ok=OK",
